# Hypervisor (10x) ACT4 Test Plan — Persistent Reference

**Source spreadsheet:** `Hypervisor (10x).xlsx`
**Full exports:** `hypervisor-10x-test-plan.md` (human-readable), `hypervisor-10x-test-plan.json` (machine-readable, all 31 sheets)

When working on RISC-V Hypervisor extension verification, ACT4, or coverpoint/test development, consult these files first.

## CSR Inventory (from H - US sheet)

**Machine H-extension:** mtval2, mtinst

**HS H-extension:** hstatus, hedeleg, hideleg, hie, hcounteren, hgeie, henvcfg, htval, hip, hvip, htinst, hgatp, hgeip (+ htimedelta; + hedelegh, htimedeltah, henvcfgh for RV32)

**VS H-extension:** vsstatus, vsie, vstval, vsip, vstvec, vsscratch, vsepc, vscause, vsatp (+ vstimecmp; + vstimecmph for RV32)

**S CSRs with VS replicas:** sstatus, sie, stvec, sscratch, sepc, scause, stval, sip, satp

**S CSRs without VS replicas:** scounteren, senvcfg, scountinhibit

## Trap Handler Logging Requirements

- **M-mode:** mcause, mepc, mtval, mstatus (GVA, MPP, MPV, MPIE, MIE), mtinst, mtval2
- **HS-mode:** scause, sepc, stval, sstatus (SPP, SPIE), hstatus (GVA, SPV, SPVP), htinst, htval
- **VS-mode:** scause/sepc/stval/sstatus (VS versions), vsstatus.SPP, SPIE

